---
layout: minimal.njk
title: Blog
description: "Practical guides and essays on data engineering, backend systems, local LLMs, AI agents, and Linux by Yashank Kothari."
section: blog
permalink: "{{ '/blog/' if site.design == 'minimal' else '/minimal/blog/' }}"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% set posts = collections.post | reverse %}
<div class="blog-heading"><h1>Writing</h1><p>Notes from building things. Sometimes the things are pipelines.</p></div>
<div class="blog-controls">
  <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter writing by topic">
    <button class="on" data-f="all" aria-pressed="true">All <span>{{ posts | length }}</span></button>
    {% for f, label in {data:"Data",backend:"Backend",genai:"AI & LLMs",agents:"Agents",essays:"Essays",linux:"Linux"} %}
    <button data-f="{{ f }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ label }}</button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <label class="search-label"><span class="sr-only">Search article titles and topics</span><input type="search" id="post-search" placeholder="Find a note…" autocomplete="off"></label>
</div>
<p class="search-status sr-only" aria-live="polite"></p>
<div class="archive">
{% set lastYear = "" %}
{% for post in posts %}
{% set year = post.date | year %}
{% if year != lastYear %}{% if not loop.first %}</ul></section>{% endif %}<section class="archive-year"><h2>{{ year }}</h2><ul class="posts">{% set lastYear = year %}{% endif %}
  <li class="post archive-row" data-tag="{{ post.data.tags | topic }}" data-search="{{ (post.data.title + ' ' + (post.data.tags | join(' '))) | lower | escape }}">
    <a href="{{ post.url }}"><span class="post-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span><span class="post-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | shortDate }}</time><span>· {{ post.templateContent | readingTime }} min</span></span></a>
  </li>
{% if loop.last %}</ul></section>{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
</div>
<p class="empty-search" hidden>No notes match that search. Try another word or topic.</p>
<p class="archive-footnote">Prefer a feed? <a href="/feed.xml">Follow via RSS</a>. Or explore <a href="/blog/tags/data-engineering/">data engineering</a>, <a href="/blog/tags/genai/">AI</a>, and the rest of the <a href="/blog/tags/backend/">backend notes</a>.</p>
